                                "sense_id": "e68489d0-cbc3-3f57-a9bc-0827ebf00a47",
                                "text": "[…] the birth of Christ, when these long valleys […] were still extensive lakes, sloppings of the great deluge, not yet dried up in time to pass away from the evaporation of the sun's rays and the labour of mankind."
                            },
