                                "sense_id": "e68489d0-cbc3-3f57-a9bc-0827ebf00a47",
                                "text": "It is only fair to say that they could have been removed by hand in the dark, but on examining the table, I was unable to see any of those sloppings of water which might be expected to follow such an operation."
                            }
